      "rev_n_1_a9bbe6_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_a9bbe6_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_a9bbe6",
        "thought_text": "The current approach of using a prefix sum array and inserting a 1 when a zero-sum subsegment is detected is not sufficient. It fails to handle cases where multiple zero-sum subsegments overlap or when inserting a single element doesn't resolve all zero-sum subsegments. A more robust approach would be to track the frequency of each prefix sum and use this information to determine the minimum number of insertions needed to break all zero-sum subsegments.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_a9bbe6_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_585a7135e7",
        "created_at": 1794516733.107648
      },
      "rev_n_2_876a6c_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_876a6c_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_876a6c",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach of inserting a 1 after each repeated prefix sum was incorrect. It didn't account for the possibility of inserting multiple elements to break multiple zero-sum subsegments. A more effective approach would be to track the longest subsegment with a non-zero sum ending at each position, and use this information to determine the minimum number of insertions needed.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_876a6c_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_36b8c45e3b",
        "created_at": 1794516818.6555724
      },
      "rev_n_3_72c7b0_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_72c7b0_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_72c7b0",
        "thought_text": "The current approach of resetting the prefix sum and clearing the set when a zero-sum subarray is detected is incorrect. Instead, we should only reset the prefix sum and continue tracking all prefix sums encountered so far. This allows us to detect zero-sum subarrays that span multiple elements.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_72c7b0_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_7c17b8a913",
