        "node_id": "n_8_9bc41f",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach of inserting a 1 after each repeated prefix sum was incorrect because it didn't account for the possibility of inserting multiple elements to break multiple zero-sum subsegments. A more effective approach would be to track the longest subsegment with a non-zero sum ending at each position, and use this information to determine the minimum number of insertions needed. This approach ensures that we can handle cases where multiple zero-sum subsegments exist and require multiple insertions to break them all.",
