        "node_id": "n_14_3f8871",
        "thought_text": "We need to modify the algorithm to keep track of the minimum number of insertions required to avoid zero-sum subarrays. Instead of just incrementing a counter, we should calculate the number of insertions needed based on the distance between the current element and the previous occurrence of the same prefix sum.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-4658438411225816332",
