        "thought_text": "The current approach of using a dictionary to store prefix sums and their indices is correct, but we need to adjust our calculation of insertions. Instead of adding zero_sum_length - 1 to the insertions count, we should add zero_sum_length. This is because we need to insert elements between the two occurrences of the same prefix sum to break the zero-sum subarray, and the number of insertions needed is equal to the length of the subarray plus one.",
